WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.930
Welcome to IDL Attendance.

2
00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.970
Here is how it works, step by step.

3
00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.880
Instructor: Attendance in five steps.

4
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.250
Create a class

5
00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:18.340
On the My Classes screen, tap “Create Class” and type the class name.

6
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.830
Invite your students

7
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:25.080
Open the class, tap “Invite Students” and share the class code.

8
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.550
Students join by entering it.

9
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.480
If you asked for approval, accept them in the Students tab.

10
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.350
Start attendance

11
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.420
Tap “Start Attendance” and choose how:

12
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.090
QR code: students scan the code on your screen.

13
00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.040
Digital button: students confirm on their own phone.

14
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.300
Manual list: you mark them yourself.

15
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.110
Pick a distance so nobody can check in from outside the classroom.

16
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.370
End attendance

17
00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.460
When you are done, tap “End Attendance”.

18
00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:03.280
Records stay in the History tab, where you can also download the Excel report.

19
00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.610
Send announcements and messages

20
00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.615
In the Communication tab, post an announcement

21
00:01:09.615 --> 00:01:12.480
to the whole class or message a single student.

22
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.510
They get a notification.

23
00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:19.230
Student: Attendance in four steps.

24
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:22.100
Join a class

25
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.250
Tap “Join Class” and type the class code your instructor gave you.

26
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.090
If approval is required, you get a notification once you are accepted.

27
00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.960
Check in

28
00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:39.090
When attendance starts you get a notification and the class card turns green.

29
00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:41.410
Tap “Join Attendance”.

30
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.670
If your instructor shows a QR code, scan it.

31
00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.230
You need to be in the classroom.

32
00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.790
Track your attendance

33
00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:53.229
Open the class: the Summary tab shows your attendance

34
00:01:53.229 --> 00:01:55.980
rate and the History tab lists every session.

35
00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.970
If something is wrong, message your instructor.

36
00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.390
Read announcements and messages

37
00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:06.250
They are in the Announcements and Messages tabs of the class.

38
00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:09.390
You get a notification when a new one arrives.

39
00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.830
You can watch this video again anytime under “How to Use”.

